our people do a single thing!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G28","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G28","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry, Mr. K writes for the pet and baby section of our magazine, so he has a shorter temper than most."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Bodyguard1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Human Bodyguard","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mind your tone, Mr. Native!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The hell you say?! You're a native too!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ahaha, don't worry, I fully understand the concerns of the native residents. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As you can see, I've even hired several natives as bodyguards. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I trust and understand humans very well, both psychologically and biologically..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"WA2000","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"WA2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What the hell is she saying...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know that the biological makeup of natives is too...\"civilized\", and I sincerely hope this doesn't come across as discriminatory, but I know that your requirements for living environments are stricter than most."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please don't play dumb! What we need is a proper answer!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh my, that's because we've been quietly working behind the scene. I'm not obliged to make everything I do public, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"G28","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G28","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But...Miss Prime Minister, the citizens elected you three years ago. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Do you think...making such a statement will please everyone?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't care who elected Dorothy, I didn't vote for her! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How could a Lilim with unknown origins be the Prime Minister!? And do you even know what her private life is like?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've had it! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ever since the sand rains began to fall, I've been doing my best to solve them, and I've been putting up with all kinds of rumors! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But in the end, this sort of thing still happened anyway! Why is it that nothing I do can please everyone! Mr. Bodyguard, please escort him off the stage to cool off!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Bodyguard1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Human Bodyguard","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry, Mr. Native Reporter, please come this way."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Bodyguard1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dammit! Everyone, is this the outcome you want? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This city's on its last leg. What the hell are you people even doing?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Bodyguard1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Human Bodyguard","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please hurry and don't make trouble here—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":"Human Bodyguard","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"—Aaaaaaaaarrrrrgh!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What -!?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...The Doll reporter Gr G28 suddenly grabs the human bodyguard's arm and takes him down, then proceeds to subdue him with a textbook wrestling finisher."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Gr G28? You— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You know the \"Walls of Jericho\"?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G28","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G28","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Eh!? Why did I suddenly do that to Mr. Bodyguard? I-I didn't do it on purpose!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Gr G28, you are disrupting the order of the venue an