 hold out a while longer. But you employed native bodyguards to curry favor with the people, yet they do not have the right to do anything to the Dolls. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone, is this fairness and freedom? Are these shallow acts really enough to gain your sincere approval?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Stella","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uuu... You! What are you up to!?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Stella","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm going to reveal your true face! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You took Alma and hid the Earth Computer!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Stella","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Stella steps onto the podium and approaches Dorothy."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Stella","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alma? The Earth Computer? I don't know where they are!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Stella","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sorry, but I'll be the judge of that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Stella","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wh-White Knights! Hurry up and restore order!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do it, Crimson Rose!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_rifle_finalshot_3h","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Bang! Bang! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":" Gunshots from afar instantly pierce the critical modules of several mechanized White Knight units rushing up from behind, and they fall apart on the spot."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Eh!? What happened!?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"WA2000","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"WA2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All targets eliminated, Stella. It's a three-star victory. ","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"WA2000","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You really are worth your price tag. I shouldn't have expected anything less of one of Griffin City's \"Grim Reapers\". I apologize for my discourtesy earlier."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"WA2000","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"WA2000","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Anyone who comes across that name would think some middle-schooler came up with it, which is precisely why we're so dangerous.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"WA2000","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":"